Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:17:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selections so pane text can be yanked

Terminal command mode exposes vim-style character, line, and block selections over the focused pane. Copy actions flow through UiAction::CopySelection so terminal adapters can emit one OSC52 clipboard sequence while the UI harness can assert the selected text directly.
